{"id": "c73", "kind": "web", "text": "다른 모델이나 다른 계정으로 넘긴 Sonnet 5.5 thinking 블록은 API 가 버린다 (09)", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "What's new 고정 사본 (text_sha256 82a7edaf…) 기준", "evidence": [{"source": "d4", "locator": "§Thinking blocks stay with the account", "quote": "When another account sends one of these blocks, the API drops the block before the model sees it, and the request succeeds."}, {"source": "d4", "locator": "§Thinking blocks are tied", "quote": "When a request carries a block the target model can't read, the API drops it before the model sees it"}]}
